{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01945","headline":"杂曲歌辞 摩多楼子 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 摩多楼子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉塞去金人，二万四千里。\n风吹沙作云，一时渡辽水。\n天白水如练，甲丝双串断。\n行行莫苦辛，城月犹残半。\n晓气朔烟上，趢趗胡马蹏。\n行人听水别，隔陇长东西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}